## 5. Interaction with Other Personas

- **With Services Persona**: Provides the exact table names, column names, and RPC function names that the Supabase Edge Functions and Swift SDK will call.
- **With iOS/UI Persona**: Has no direct interaction. iOS UI only interacts through the Services layer.
